{"ID":"20240205153720-2k6v1yb","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153720-2k6v1yb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153720-2k6v1yb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102932-ln6qfw7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619190013-wnort18\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1422\u0026#125;","title":"使君子","type":"doc","updated":"20240830135852"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102932-ln6qfw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102932-ln6qfw7","updated":"20240206102942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、广东、广西等地。\n【性状】\t呈椭圆形或卵圆形，具5条纵棱，偶有49棱，长2.54cm，直径约2cm。表面黑褐色至紫黑色，平滑，微具光泽。顶端狭尖，基部钝圆，有明显圆形的果梗痕。质坚硬，横切面多呈五角星形，棱角处壳较厚，中间呈类圆形空腔。种子长椭圆形或纺锤形，长约2cm，直径约1cm；表面棕褐色或黑褐色，有多数纵皱纹；种皮薄，易剥离；子叶2，黄白色，有油性，断面有裂纹。微香，味微甜。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t杀虫消积。用于蛔虫、蛲虫病，虫积腹痛，小儿疳积。"}]},{"ID":"20240206102933-c5uzwv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102933-c5uzwv1","updated":"20240206102933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102933-ags8re4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162441-eoimqea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162441-eoimqea","updated":"20240709155205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"使君子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/使君子-20240205162441-k8tkmdm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709155207-gbfjsd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709155207-gbfjsd7","updated":"20240709155207"},"Children":[{"Ty